  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy - SRHR in UHC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultuppdrag - SRHR i UHC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy for regional SRHR team, for the benefit of team Sweden SRHR in UHC initiative to ensure UHC standards, policies and schemes are inclusive of SRH service and based on principles of gender equality and equity and access, leaving no-one behind. The purpose is to develop an evidence framework for SRHR in UHC and gap analysis, select a small number of countries to focus on integrating SRHR in UHC, show results and scale up, and support team Sweden&#x2019;s efforts to better align global funding mechanisms to support UHC/SRHR investments.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Konsultuppdrag f&#xf6;r att bidra till metodutveckling och studier inom ramen f&#xf6;r Team Sweden/Global h&#xe4;lsas arbete att, genom regionala SRHR teamet, samordna Sveriges ambition att s&#xe4;kra att sexuell och reproduktiv h&#xe4;lsa och r&#xe4;ttigheter integreras inom ramen f&#xf6;r politiska-, tekniskas-, strategiska- och ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande processers som nu p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r globalt, regionalt och nationellt f&#xf6;r tillg&#xe5;ng till allm&#xe4;n sjukv&#xe5;rd (Universal Health Coverage &#x2013; UHC).</narrative>
  </description>
